9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:04,000
The organization's members harbor a deep hatred of the Clover Kingdom, which drives their acts of terrorism against our country.

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Their ultimate goal is to establish a sovereign state.

11
