44
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:25,540
Who among those gathered here is the traitorous captain who collaborated with the Eye of the Midnight Sun?

45
00:03:28,220 --> 00:03:30,640
Go on. Tell us their name.

46
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:32,660
The traitor.

47
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,460
