48
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:39,100
Gelder Poizot.

49
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:43,240
Ugh. Ridiculous. What are you trying to say?

50
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:47,100
These two are terrorists guilty of attacking the royal capital itself.

51
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:50,260
You would have to be crazy to believe a word out of their mouths.

52
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:54,140
I've never given anyone cause to doubt my loyalty to this kingdom.

53
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,120
Well, that isn't exactly true.

54
00:03:57,160 --> 00:04:00,340
I have heard a few distasteful rumors regarding you.

55
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:04,240
Is that all, Charlotte? I've heard a great deal more than a few.

56
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:06,260
No way. Are you guys serious?

57
00:04:06,260 --> 00:04:11,060
Sure are. There are rumors all over the damn place. It's crazy.

58
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:15,240
And now it seems they weren't baseless after all.

59
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:20,660
I always knew that you were up to something sneaky, but I never imagined even you would stoop to this level.

60
00:04:21,140 --> 00:04:24,200
This isn't funny. There's obviously been a mistake.

61
00:04:24,580 --> 00:04:27,780
Yes. Those two are trying to set me up and you're all falling for it.

62
00:04:27,780 --> 00:04:32,820
Impossible. They've answered honestly with all the information at their disposal.

63
00:04:33,860 --> 00:04:37,720
Anything said under the spell's compulsion is true, without a doubt.

64
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:40,440
There you have it, Hammy.

65
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,600
Who are you calling Hammy?

66
00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:43,740
Hey now, calm down.

67
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:47,140
