68
00:04:47,380 --> 00:04:50,020
He can sneak a little peek inside that head of yours.

69
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:53,360
If you've been a good ham, you'll have nothing to worry about.

70
00:04:53,900 --> 00:04:56,280
Apart from the stupid nickname, I agree completely.

71
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:59,460
If you're truly innocent, you should jump at the chance to prove it.

72
00:04:59,820 --> 00:05:01,440
Well, I... don't know.

73
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:03,740
Hey, what's the matter there, Hammy?

74
00:05:03,900 --> 00:05:05,440
You get shy all of a sudden?

75
00:05:05,860 --> 00:05:07,580
Most disgraceful, Gelder.

76
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,700
Such a betrayal is unforgivable.

77
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:11,600
It should be a capital offense.

78
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,760
So you really are a traitor then?

79
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:15,340
You jerk!

80
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,300
You betrayed your fellow captain!

81
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:19,320
No!

82
00:05:19,940 --> 00:05:21,140
This is some kind of trap!

83
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,160
I'll find a way to clear my name.

84
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:25,040
But for now, I'll have to retreat!

85
00:05:25,580 --> 00:05:26,940
Transparacy creation magic!

86
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,220
Activating the invisible mage!

87
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:35,120
He's gone!

88
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,540
Ha! He's making a run for it.

89
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:39,620
Things are getting serious now.

90
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:40,740
Not good.

91
00:05:41,260 --> 00:05:41,980
He's invisible.

92
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:45,840
And as long as he is, all magic will pass right through him.

93
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:48,160
So basically, we're screwed.

94
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:51,540
None of our attack spells will work on the faster while he's like this.

95
00:05:52,140 --> 00:05:52,780
What?!

96
00:05:52,780 --> 00:05:54,400
So he's invincible now?!

97
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:56,120
Transparacy creation magic!

98
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:57,580
Invisible troops!

99
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:01,320
That ought to keep them occupied for a bit.

100
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:11,360
I can't let him head away.

101
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:18,640
Hey!

102
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:19,540
Come on, Dorothy!

103
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:21,660
This isn't the time to be sleeping on the job!

104
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:29,480
I don't suppose anyone knows how to chase somebody you can't see!

105
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:31,880
Yami?

106
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:33,740
Don't worry.

107
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:34,560
We got this.

108
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:39,680
Did they think I would just stand there and let them capture me?

109
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,800
With my magic, I'm untouchable!

110
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:45,640
This is the power that made me a magic knight captain in the first place!

111
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:50,980
Then there's my incomparable business acumen, which made me an influential tycoon!

112
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:55,220
Between the two, I've become a great mage rich in both money and might!

113
00:06:55,220 --> 00:07:00,820
My story isn't going to end here.

114
00:07:04,340 --> 00:07:07,760
Thanks to my magical talent and financial genius, I'm unstoppable!

115
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:08,420
Oh!

116
00:07:11,420 --> 00:07:11,760
Gotcha!

117
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:12,280
Gotcha!

118
00:07:13,460 --> 00:07:13,940
What?

119
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,140
Where did you come from?

120
00:07:17,980 --> 00:07:18,920
That's impossible!

121
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:21,080
You saw me through my magic?

122
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:22,340
Little brat!

123
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,600
How did you attack me?

124
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:28,600
Well, ol' Hammy's transparency magic may be able to hide him

125
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,660
But hiding his key is another story

126
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:34,260
And since an anti-magic sword isn't, you know, magic

127
00:07:34,260 --> 00:07:36,120
It can hit him just fine

128
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:39,320
Well, I guess we know what his natural enemy is now

129
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:42,360
A magicless boy who knows how to read key

130
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:48,180
You can't win! I'm a magic knight captain!

131
00:07:48,180 --> 00:07:51,300
You are some magicless commoner!

132
00:07:53,600 --> 00:08:03,460
Yes, that's excellent

133
00:08:03,460 --> 00:08:07,020
The writhing on the floor like a desperate fish look suits you quite well

134
00:08:07,020 --> 00:08:07,700
No way!

135
00:08:09,700 --> 00:08:13,600
You're a magic knight captain! You're supposed to be better than this!

136
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,780
Now come back and face me!

137
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,840
All right then

138
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:20,540
If you want to die that badly, I'll help you

139
00:08:20,540 --> 00:08:23,080
But don't say I didn't give you a fair warning

140
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:26,200
Well, hello there

141
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:31,000
If you could just stay still a moment, please

142
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:57,740
Picture magic, spring of restriction

143
